<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V TASMANIA 1STDAY CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V TASMANIA 1STDAY CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tasmania were 73-1 in</p>
<p>reply to Pakistan's 299 all out at the close of play on the</p>
<p>first day of a four-day match at the Bellerive Oval on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 299 (Shahid Afridi 80, Mushtaq Ahmed 65,</p>
<p>Shaun Young 7-64); Tasmania 73-1.</p>
